or is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\">Lured</a> by the Harpy's song.</li>\n<li>Success grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resisted_the_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Resisted the Song (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resisted the Song\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resisted_the_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Resisted the Song (Condition)\">Resisted the Song</a> condition for 2 turns. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LURING_SONG</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLURING_SONG%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLURING_SONG%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 0\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Lured\">Condition: Lured</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\">Lured</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity is attracted to a harpy's luring melody and uses its turn to move closer to the harpy, possibly provoking opportunity attacks from the other harpies.</li>\n<li>The affected entity must pass a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;13 Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;13 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> at the start of their turn or remain lured.</li>\n<li>Taking damage or being <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shoved</a> removes the condition.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Resisted_the_Song\">Condition: Resisted the Song</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resisted_the_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Resisted the Song (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resisted the Song\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resisted_the_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Resisted the Song (Condition)\">Resisted the Song</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity succeeded a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against the harpy's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song\" title=\"Luring Song\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/25px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/38px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/50px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Luring Song\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/25px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song\" title=\"Luring Song\">Luring Song</a> and is immune to the effects for 2 turns.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Luring_Song\">Sources of Luring Song</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Singing_(Condition)\" title=\"Singing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Singing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Singing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Singing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Singing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Singing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Singing_(Condition)\" title=\"Singing (Condition)\">Singing</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>LURING_SONG</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Lured\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\">Lured</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected entity is attracted to a harpy's luring melody and uses its turn to move closer to the harpy, possibly provoking opportunity attacks from the other harpies.</li>\n<li>The affected entity must pass a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;13 Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;13 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> at the start of their turn or remain lured.</li>\n<li>Taking damage or being <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shoved</a> removes the condition.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Luring_Song\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Luring Song (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Luring Song\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Luring Song</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected entity must succeed a Wisdom <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> every turn or is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lured (Condition)\">Lured</a> by the Harpy's song.</li>\n<li>Success grants the <a href=\"/wiki/Resisted_the_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Resisted the Song (Condition)\">Resisted the Song</a> condition for 2 turns.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Resisted_the_Song\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resisted_the_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Resisted the Song (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resisted the Song\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Resisted_the_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Resisted_the_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Resisted the Song (Condition)\">Resisted the Song</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected entity succeeded a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against the harpy's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song\" title=\"Luring Song\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/25px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/38px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/50px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Luring Song\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/25px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song\" title=\"Luring Song\">Luring Song</a> and is immune to the effects for 2 turns.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202320\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.096 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3722/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47951/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12768/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.038/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1249610/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   85.535      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   85.535      1 -total\n 50.94%   43.569      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.09%   20.604      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 24.02%   20.547     13 Template:Icon_text\n 23.60%   20.189     12 Template:Icon_link\n 19.67%   16.828     37 Template:Trim\n 17.83%   15.247      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.43%   12.346      6 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 13.52%   11.568      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18997-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202320 and revision id 